Package: com.xxzzddxzd.dsh-vless
Name: DSH VLESS Client
Version: @PACKAGE_VERSION@
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Loopback-only Xray VLESS client for selected DSH providers
 Contains an iPhoneOS arm64 Xray binary, a fail-closed local HTTP proxy
 configuration, a rootless-jailbreak signature, and a launchd service.
Maintainer: xxzzddxzd
Section: Networking
Depends: firmware (>= @IOS_MIN_VERSION@), ldid
Tag: purpose::console, role::developer
Homepage: https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-core
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
